# Rule Precedence

When guidance conflicts, prefer in this order:

1. Explicit user instruction in the current chat
2. Active OpenSpec change artifacts (`proposal` / `design` / `specs` / `tasks`)
3. Glob-scoped project rule matching the files being edited
4. Always-apply project rules
5. Generic model knowledge

Within always-apply project rules:

- `erp-core` (QR-first / minimal payload) wins over generic fat REST forms
- `multi-client-api` wins over “one heavy serializer for all clients”
- Business logic belongs in `services/` (see `django-drf-conventions`), not in generic “put logic in forms/templates” advice
